^edqtFlags=This flag field defines more specifically the type of quest it is. $B$BAside from the daily flag, this field is used just for grouping purposes and NOT for any other quest requirements. $B$BThe quest requirements are calculated from non-zero values in other quest template fields. $B$BAlso, while some of these flags are known, others have yet an unknown purpose and the comments is simply guesswork on them.
